<title>USA: FAIRFIELD TO ACQUIRE VACATION BREAK.</title>
<headline>FAIRFIELD TO ACQUIRE VACATION BREAK.</headline>
<dateline>LITTLE ROCK, Ark. 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fairfield Communities Inc said Sunday it signed a definitive agreement to acquire Vacation Break U.S.A. Inc in an all stock deal valued at about $190.2 million.</p>
<p>Fairfield said it will issue 0.6075 share of common stock in exchange for each share of Vacation Break's outstanding common stock. It said the $190.2 million value of the deal is based on the closing price of its common stock on August 8.</p>
</text>
